        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "4dc2e116-df1e-3898-86d2-85e39062e294",
                "word": "lassitude",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "27f8bc6b-9098-4938-84c6-ecb84f8551e1",
                        "entry_id": "4dc2e116-df1e-3898-86d2-85e39062e294",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "lassitudes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "384ae00f-a6fc-365f-ae2d-f8f04ef259af",
                        "entry_id": "4dc2e116-df1e-3898-86d2-85e39062e294",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Sensation de fatigue causée par une mauvaise disposition de santé."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cfb38c68-b017-401a-853b-db5b240da22f",
                                "sense_id": "384ae00f-a6fc-365f-ae2d-f8f04ef259af",
                                "text": "J’avais les membres roidis et ressentais une si pénible lassitude, que je restai longtemps sans pouvoir trouver le sommeil."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "85df95c1-146f-4ef4-b712-2450faf8cbaa",
                                "sense_id": "384ae00f-a6fc-365f-ae2d-f8f04ef259af",
                                "text": "Il a renoncé à cette correspondance par pure lassitude d’avoir toujours les mêmes choses à dire."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3068a9b8-306b-34b6-857d-d4a8aa7f5f7a",
                        "entry_id": "4dc2e116-df1e-3898-86d2-85e39062e294",
                        "glosses": [
                            "État de celui qui est las, de celle qui est lasse, au propre et au figuré."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7be6ab91-4053-4b5e-998e-8a36c52f8f3c",
                                "sense_id": "3068a9b8-306b-34b6-857d-d4a8aa7f5f7a",
                                "text": "La douceur alanguie du printemps ne faisait que rendre plus lourde la lassitude de Zaheira."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9edc1ef3-942b-4fa7-adb5-8b296473b085",
                                "sense_id": "3068a9b8-306b-34b6-857d-d4a8aa7f5f7a",
                                "text": "Une restauration n’est possible qu’aux brefs instants de lassitude quand les idées, les hommes et les faits s'accordent une trêve, quand l’essoufflement rompt l’assaut des générations montantes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f25eede9-8a55-4f61-b466-ce33cc44424f",
                                "sense_id": "3068a9b8-306b-34b6-857d-d4a8aa7f5f7a",
                                "text": "Je l’écoutais à peine. J’avais cédé de guerre lasse. Elle avait l’ardeur de ses 16 ans et moi la lassitude de mes sept décennies."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "14cfae17-55a4-41c7-b771-f9ffedd742ab",
                        "source_entry_id": "4dc2e116-df1e-3898-86d2-85e39062e294",
                        "target_lang_word": "Müdigkeit",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Müdigkeit",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6bf2bffb-617a-3460-8f4e-5773c20f8561",
                                        "entry_id": "34be500c-ea5e-3807-ab22-9a5f95ce6694",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Zustand des Schlafmangels oder des Unausgeruhtseins"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e488c2b-b5db-4c16-b5e6-2d568f3e01f7",
                                                "sense_id": "6bf2bffb-617a-3460-8f4e-5773c20f8561",
                                                "text": "„Es überkam sie jenes Träumen von nie wiederkehrenden Dingen, jene Müdigkeit, die uns angesichts jeder unabänderlichen Tatsache übermannt, jener Schmerz schließlich, den uns die Unterbrechung jeder gewohnt gewordenen Bewegung bringt, das jähe Aufhören einer Schwingung, die lange angedauert hat.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "30a4b18c-fb89-4c8a-826d-613063acdb92",
                                                "sense_id": "6bf2bffb-617a-3460-8f4e-5773c20f8561",
                                                "text": "Die Müdigkeit überkam sie sofort nach der Arbeit."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb46582a-6f0f-4cf8-9611-529ddfae852e",
                                                "sense_id": "6bf2bffb-617a-3460-8f4e-5773c20f8561",
                                                "text": "„Ich verspürte Müdigkeit, und ich dachte daran, daß ich am nächsten Morgen früh an Deck zu sein hatte.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4bdb4ae8-eeed-4bf0-93b1-e1f36e342d0c",
                                                "sense_id": "6bf2bffb-617a-3460-8f4e-5773c20f8561",
                                                "text": "„Eine halbe Flasche Rotwein half mir, aus der überdrehten Müdigkeit in den Schlaf zu finden.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61fc9545-d0c9-4abb-84b8-ae8a779ada62",
                                                "sense_id": "6bf2bffb-617a-3460-8f4e-5773c20f8561",
                                                "text": "„Eine Wolke von Müdigkeit lagert noch über ihm.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4a5b3523-39f1-4772-9a19-8c05879c6d5e",
                                                "sense_id": "6bf2bffb-617a-3460-8f4e-5773c20f8561",
                                                "text": "Als ich ihn fragte, woher er so müde ist, meinte er: \"Auf den Winterschlaf folgt die Frühjahrsmüdigkeit gefolgt von der Sommerlethargie\"."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cf679eb1-5676-45c9-8438-5fde94db9e22",
                                                "sense_id": "6bf2bffb-617a-3460-8f4e-5773c20f8561",
                                                "text": "Nach dem Marathon spürte ich eine Müdigkeit."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "86c8c481-f77e-32b1-9355-2bad483a9d73",
                                        "entry_id": "34be500c-ea5e-3807-ab22-9a5f95ce6694",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Zustand der Überanstrengung"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2076e9e6-884c-4911-ac5f-bd6aeeae0ff1",
                                                "sense_id": "86c8c481-f77e-32b1-9355-2bad483a9d73",
                                                "text": "Nach dem Marathon spürte ich eine Müdigkeit."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5371e764-f871-4c46-b1a9-f26f28491222",
                        "source_entry_id": "4dc2e116-df1e-3898-86d2-85e39062e294",
                        "target_lang_word": "weariness",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "weariness",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eb210271-1bb3-3d0b-8e94-f759c43a7147",
                                        "entry_id": "ae0af971-9010-3e99-850a-03a916c3f334",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Exhaustion, fatigue or tiredness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "abef2395-f571-4ebe-805e-ae200725f5e2",
                                                "sense_id": "eb210271-1bb3-3d0b-8e94-f759c43a7147",
                                                "text": "Now when he had reached the King's capital wherein was Alaeddin, he alighted at one of the Kháns; and, when he had rested from the weariness of wayfare, he donned his dress and went down to wander about the streets, where he never passed a group without hearing them prate about the pavilion and its grandeur and vaunt the beauty of Alaeddin and his lovesomeness, his liberality and generosity, his fine manners and his good morals."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4b3ef34f-5e71-39af-b75a-293343b82323",
                                        "entry_id": "ae0af971-9010-3e99-850a-03a916c3f334",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A lack of interest or excitement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3cdfc93f-717b-41f8-af40-4cc6903a3d0b",
                                                "sense_id": "4b3ef34f-5e71-39af-b75a-293343b82323",
                                                "text": "“From the end of the Bush years up through 2013 and ’14, there was a war weariness that was permeating even Republicans,” said David Boaz, author of a new book “The Libertarian Mind.” “However, the videos of ISIS beheading Americans and other people have certainly made it more difficult to stick to a noninterventionist argument.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "68b879c4-5cce-417b-8644-4556d8204d0f",
                        "source_entry_id": "4dc2e116-df1e-3898-86d2-85e39062e294",
                        "target_lang_word": "lassitude",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "lassitude",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5d1b1096-0296-3bd1-bb23-48e249d50dbe",
                                        "entry_id": "c52e0b27-8a7c-33b8-9313-38d80b685716",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Lethargy or lack of energy; fatigue, languor, listlessness"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "41f0094c-5ce3-479d-a794-dc53062ac19d",
                                                "sense_id": "5d1b1096-0296-3bd1-bb23-48e249d50dbe",
                                                "text": "Rufus Dawes, though his eyelids would scarcely keep open, and a terrible lassitude almost paralysed his limbs, eagerly drank in the whispered sentence."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "97a6337e-f85a-47e4-a807-e3f112be81f2",
                                                "sense_id": "5d1b1096-0296-3bd1-bb23-48e249d50dbe",
                                                "text": "Rufus Dawes, though his eyelids would scarcely keep open, and a terrible lassitude almost paralysed his limbs, eagerly drank in the whispered sentence."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e3ca8e9-4fee-41b4-b589-2a5475c53d51",
                                                "sense_id": "5d1b1096-0296-3bd1-bb23-48e249d50dbe",
                                                "text": "\"Then it's No, darling?\" he said at last.\nShe gave a gesture of lassitude. She was exhausted.\n\"The studio is yours. Everything belongs to you. If you want to bring him here, how can I prevent you?\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4af92d1a-24cc-4f81-a8ee-bb898ea92e9a",
                                                "sense_id": "5d1b1096-0296-3bd1-bb23-48e249d50dbe",
                                                "text": "In order to appear busy, one should pace around the office clutching files.... The best part of this ancient ritual is that it tends to make one's colleagues look away—just in case you and your papers are going to interrupt their own lassitude."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1e5a0ee-883c-41b4-8714-8cbd326c1fda",
                                                "sense_id": "5d1b1096-0296-3bd1-bb23-48e249d50dbe",
                                                "text": "At Euro 2004 and the 2002 World Cup, Blatter commented this week, many stars were physically and mentally exhausted, and left an aftertaste of nonchalance and lassitude."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
